fighter3 (istek) said era of knight changelog Vending machine has been added to the build menu.
Friends, there was a problem with the server, unfortunately I started editing from the beginning again, sorry for the problems.
Local chats can now be disabled as well as normal server chat!
You can now enable and disable private messages in the f7 menu, a minor issue with the feature has been fixed.
Made a minor adjustment to the nickname system.
Fixed the issue that occurred when someone killed you.
Safe zone fighting mode added! This may sound ridiculous to you, but it's a great system to get your team kills and points! Faster fight and more fun!
Added new commands for administrators and developers.
Some bugs have been fixed.
Map loading sounds issue fixed.
The helicopter has been added and I need your help for the helicopter! This is because I cannot adjust the health of the helicopter and cannot adjust how many health drops when it hits people. Waiting for your ideas, hope you post ideas.
Fixed a problem with falling.
Achievements have been removed, and unnecessary code has been deleted.
Fixed an issue where some sounds were not being heard.
Adds platforms and sound sources that cannot be found in the build menu.
You can now enable and disable the keyboard typing feedback sound by pressing f1 from the options menu or in the chat box.
Now when the reboot command is used, the server will start in 10 seconds, rather than 5 seconds.
Restart option has been added to the main menu of the game, this option allows you to restart the game, you do not need to exit the game and open it again.
Fixed a bug with the map delete command.
Fixed the issue where some sounds were heard on all maps except the map.
You can now enable and disable the buffer beep sound from the settings menu.
The error that occurred while creating the release has been fixed. The releaser will now work smoother.
 1-28-2021, 1:17:34 PM
